'''The White Rabbit''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes (Gacha Event)|Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes]] and [[RED BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|RED BUSTERS]] events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]] has a 100% chance to [[Knockback|knockback]] and [[Weaken|weaken]] [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] and [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.5 Update|Version 10.5]]. [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]] increases health, attack power and frequency and gains Strong Against, Slow, [[Sage Slayer]], [[Multi-Hit]] and [[Long Distance]], and removes the Knockback ability.

