==Trivia==
*The White Rabbit wields a CETME-L and a MAC-11.
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], The White Rabbit was a part of three other [[Cat Combo]]s: [[Merchant + Courier (Removed Combo)|Merchant + Courier]], [[Cosplayers (Removed Combo)|Cosplayers]] and [[Tortoise and Hare (Removed Combo)|Tortoise and Hare]].
*Her Normal Form may be a reference to [[wikipedia:White Rabbit (song)|the song of the same name]] by Jefferson Airplane.
*Her Evolved Form and Ultra Form are very likely references to [[wikipedia:Catwoman|Catwoman]] from the Batman series, as she and [[Catman (Uber Rare Cat)|Catman]] are in the same set.
*Her True Form may be a reference to [[wikia:metalgear:Gray Fox|Gray Fox]] from the Metal Gear series, as both have similar names and connections to covert intelligence agencies.
